# Snack Snake 🐍🍬

Snack Snake is a simple browser-based Snake game built using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript**.  
The game has an anime-style 3D vibe, score tracking, speed increase, keyboard controls, mobile buttons, and swipe support.

## Features

- Classic snake gameplay
- Score and best score tracking
- Best score saved in browser localStorage
- Keyboard controls using Arrow keys / WASD
- Mobile touch buttons
- Swipe controls for mobile
- Pause, resume, restart options
- Speed increases as the snake eats snacks
- Responsive design

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Canvas API
- localStorage

## How to Run

1. Download or copy the `index.html` file.
2. Open the file in any modern web browser.
3. Click **Start** to play the game.

## Controls

### Keyboard

- Arrow Up / W → Move Up
- Arrow Down / S → Move Down
- Arrow Left / A → Move Left
- Arrow Right / D → Move Right
- Space → Pause / Resume
- R → Restart
- Enter → Start / Resume

### Mobile

- Use on-screen direction buttons
- Swipe on the game area to change direction

## Game Rules

- Eat snacks to increase your score.
- Snake grows longer after eating snacks.
- Avoid hitting the wall.
- Avoid hitting your own body.
- Your best score is saved on the same device.

